{"id":"ISS-20260715-001","title":"Hook runner 取消与输出上限未形成进程树边界","status":"open","priority":2,"severity":"high","source":"discovery","milestone_ref":null,"phase_ref":null,"gap_ref":null,"description":"Hook command 不接收 AbortSignal；Windows 输出超限只 kill shell，且 finish 后 data listener 仍可继续积累，可能留下孙进程或突破 1 MiB 上限。","fix_direction":"为 runCommandHook 贯穿 AbortSignal，并让 abort、timeout、output-limit 共享可等待的 terminateProcessTree；settled 后停止收集并销毁 pipe。","context":{"location":"packages/pi-maestro-flow/src/hooks/runner.ts:52","suggested_fix":"复用 SmartSearch runner 的进程树终止策略，增加 bounded byte collector 与 abort/overflow regression tests。","notes":"Odyssey SmartSearch GENERALIZE semantic hit。"},"analysis":null,"path":null,"phase_id":null,"tags":["子进程","取消","输出上限","Windows"],"affected_components":["packages/pi-maestro-flow/src/hooks/runner.ts"],"feedback":[],"issue_history":[{"timestamp":"2026-07-15T13:28:10+08:00","from_status":null,"to_status":"open","actor":"agent","note":"Issue created from odyssey generalization"}],"created_at":"2026-07-15T13:28:10+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-15T13:28:10+08:00","resolved_at":null,"resolution":null}
{"id":"ISS-20260715-002","title":"Teammate execution 缺少有界输出和可靠进程回收","status":"open","priority":2,"severity":"high","source":"discovery","milestone_ref":null,"phase_ref":null,"gap_ref":null,"description":"Teammate runner 的 abort/timeout 只 kill 直接 child，stdout/stderr 与 malformed JSONL 可无界增长，structured output 读取或解析失败被空 catch 吞掉。","fix_direction":"统一进程树终止、byte budget、bounded tail 与 structured-output typed failure；用 close 状态而非 child.killed 做 escalation。","context":{"location":"packages/pi-maestro-teammate/src/runs/execution.ts:827","suggested_fix":"添加 Windows tree-kill、增量 UTF-8 decoder、stdout/stderr ring buffer，以及 invalid structured output 回归测试。","notes":"文件当前存在用户未提交改动，故未在本次 SmartSearch 提交中直接修改。"},"analysis":null,"path":null,"phase_id":null,"tags":["teammate","子进程","JSONL","结构化输出"],"affected_components":["packages/pi-maestro-teammate/src/runs/execution.ts"],"feedback":[],"issue_history":[{"timestamp":"2026-07-15T13:28:10+08:00","from_status":null,"to_status":"open","actor":"agent","note":"Issue created from odyssey generalization"}],"created_at":"2026-07-15T13:28:10+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-15T13:28:10+08:00","resolved_at":null,"resolution":null}
{"id":"ISS-20260715-003","title":"Teammate 配置 TUI 的窄宽度返回与持久化不耐演进","status":"open","priority":3,"severity":"medium","source":"discovery","milestone_ref":null,"phase_ref":null,"gap_ref":null,"description":"Control Center 在宽度小于 20 时 nested Esc 直接关闭；model routing 保存会丢弃未知字段并直接覆盖正式 JSON，升级或中断时可能丢配置。","fix_direction":"让极窄宽度沿用 editor back-navigation；读取时保留原始 root，保存仅 patch 已知字段，并使用同目录 temp + rename。","context":{"location":"packages/pi-maestro-teammate/src/tui/model-mapping-overlay.ts:149","suggested_fix":"同步修复 model-mapping-overlay.ts 与 models/model-routing.ts，增加宽度 1..120、unknown-key round-trip、write failure tests。","notes":"相关文件当前存在用户未提交改动，故路由为 issue。"},"analysis":null,"path":null,"phase_id":null,"tags":["TUI","配置迁移","原子写入","Esc"],"affected_components":["packages/pi-maestro-teammate/src/tui/model-mapping-overlay.ts","packages/pi-maestro-teammate/src/models/model-routing.ts"],"feedback":[],"issue_history":[{"timestamp":"2026-07-15T13:28:10+08:00","from_status":null,"to_status":"open","actor":"agent","note":"Issue created from odyssey generalization"}],"created_at":"2026-07-15T13:28:10+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-15T13:28:10+08:00","resolved_at":null,"resolution":null}
{"id":"ISS-20260715-004","title":"Runtime deep import 与 wildcard peer 缺少协议锁定","status":"open","priority":3,"severity":"medium","source":"discovery","milestone_ref":null,"phase_ref":null,"gap_ref":null,"description":"pi-maestro-flow 对 teammate 使用 caret 并 deep-import src，Pi host peers 使用 optional wildcard，pi-internals 还 deep-load dist 路径；PATH fallback 和 AGENTS 资源也缺少版本或 hash handshake。","fix_direction":"对内部 deep import 采用 exact dependency 或公开 entrypoint；为 host/runtime 加 protocol/schema/version handshake，并对 fallback 明确告警。","context":{"location":"packages/pi-maestro-flow/package.json:61","suggested_fix":"分阶段收紧 teammate dependency、Pi peer range 与 deep-import contract；为 bundled resources 增加 build-time manifest/hash。","notes":"合并 syntax/semantic 层 10 个同类 risk，避免重复 issue。"},"analysis":null,"path":null,"phase_id":null,"tags":["依赖契约","deep-import","peerDependencies","版本漂移"],"affected_components":["packages/pi-maestro-flow/package.json","packages/pi-maestro-flow/src/compaction/pi-internals.ts","packages/pi-maestro-flow/src/resources/maestro-package.ts","packages/pi-maestro-teammate/package.json"],"feedback":[],"issue_history":[{"timestamp":"2026-07-15T13:28:10+08:00","from_status":null,"to_status":"open","actor":"agent","note":"Issue created from odyssey generalization"}],"created_at":"2026-07-15T13:28:10+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-15T13:28:10+08:00","resolved_at":null,"resolution":null}
{"id":"ISS-20260716-001","title":"maestro-flow commit-pinned install lacks prepared dist","status":"open","priority":2,"severity":"high","source":"verification","milestone_ref":null,"phase_ref":"20260716-001-odyssey-review","gap_ref":null,"description":"Fresh install of pinned maestro-flow commit 84ae24f8ed9a12cac3b5c69ea3428840a0a58e1b fails before the Session/Run CLI can start because the Git source package omits dist/src/utils/wasm-relaunch.js. The source package exposes prepublishOnly but no prepare or prepack step, and neither GitHub Releases nor workflow runs provide a built asset. Registry maestro-flow@0.5.50 is not a compatible substitute because it exposes the legacy run contract and lacks create/brief/check/complete/cancel, parent_run_id, and seal-session behavior.","fix_direction":"Publish a prepared artifact for the pinned commit or add a Git-install-safe prepare/prepack pipeline that builds and includes the complete dist tree without weakening the source lock.","context":{"location":"packages/pi-maestro-flow/test/packed-consumer-e2e.test.mjs","suggested_fix":"From a clean consumer, install the exact pinned Git commit and run node node_modules/maestro-flow/bin/maestro.js run create --help. Ensure dist/src/utils/wasm-relaunch.js exists and verify create/brief/check/complete/cancel plus parent_run_id on the installed artifact.","notes":"Reproduction currently throws ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND for dist/src/utils/wasm-relaunch.js. Symlink, registry downgrade, or skipped lifecycle assertions are explicitly not acceptable verification."},"analysis":null,"path":null,"phase_id":null,"tags":["packaging","source-lock","Session/Run","upstream"],"affected_components":["packages/pi-maestro-flow/package.json","packages/pi-maestro-flow/test/packed-consumer-e2e.test.mjs","maestro-flow@84ae24f8ed9a12cac3b5c69ea3428840a0a58e1b"],"feedback":[],"issue_history":[{"timestamp":"2026-07-16T16:55:55.7603053+08:00","from_status":null,"to_status":"open","actor":"agent","note":"Issue created from Odyssey packaging verification"}],"created_at":"2026-07-16T16:55:55.7603053+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-16T16:55:55.7603053+08:00","resolved_at":null,"resolution":null}
{"id":"ISS-20260716-002","title":"PlanStore refresh and release retain check-then-act TOCTOU","status":"open","priority":2,"severity":"high","source":"discovery","milestone_ref":null,"phase_ref":"20260716-001-odyssey-review","gap_ref":null,"description":"PlanStore removePendingIfOwned, refreshLock, releaseLock, and stale reclaim perform an ownership/token check followed by a separate filesystem write, rename, or directory removal. A concurrent reclaim and reacquire can occur between those operations, allowing an old owner to overwrite or delete a new owner's lock or pending approval even though PID birth identity now prevents simple PID-reuse deadlocks.","fix_direction":"Introduce a filesystem ownership guard with an atomic compare-and-swap or generation-scoped directory protocol that makes pending cleanup, refresh, reclaim, and release conditional on the same immutable claim, including crash recovery and cross-platform behavior.","context":{"location":"packages/pi-maestro-flow/src/tools/plan-store.ts:510","suggested_fix":"Design a token- or epoch-named claim directory protocol so refresh cannot replace another generation and cleanup/release removes only the caller's immutable claim. Add deterministic two-owner interleaving tests for remove-after-reclaim, refresh-after-reclaim, reclaim-after-reacquire, and release-after-reclaim.","notes":"Odyssey syntax, semantic, and focused explore scans independently confirmed four check-then-act points. The correct fix requires a new filesystem guard and crash-recovery protocol rather than a local patch."},"analysis":null,"path":null,"phase_id":null,"tags":["PlanStore","TOCTOU","锁","crash-recovery"],"affected_components":["packages/pi-maestro-flow/src/tools/plan-store.ts","packages/pi-maestro-flow/test/plan-store.test.ts"],"feedback":[{"timestamp":"2026-07-16T17:34:55.6248679+08:00","type":"clarification","content":"GENERALIZE expanded the scope from refresh/release to removePendingIfOwned and reclaim rename interleavings."}],"issue_history":[{"timestamp":"2026-07-16T16:55:55.7603053+08:00","from_status":null,"to_status":"open","actor":"agent","note":"Issue created from Odyssey sibling discovery"}],"created_at":"2026-07-16T16:55:55.7603053+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-16T17:34:55.6248679+08:00","resolved_at":null,"resolution":null}
{"id":"ISS-20260716-003","title":"Teammate long-session registries and control UI retain stale state","status":"open","priority":3,"severity":"medium","source":"discovery","milestone_ref":null,"phase_ref":"20260716-001-odyssey-review","gap_ref":null,"description":"Successful sleeping agents remain in activeRuns and namedAgents without count or TTL eviction, while Control Center active-agent data is a one-time snapshot and normal shutdown does not explicitly clear the widget context. Long sessions can retain unbounded agent records and show stale status after lifecycle changes.","fix_direction":"Define named-agent retention semantics separately from ephemeral workers; add bounded count/TTL eviction for retired ephemeral records, live refresh for Control Center snapshots, and explicit widget dispose/null on every shutdown path.","context":{"location":"packages/pi-maestro-teammate/src/extension/index.ts:2206","suggested_fix":"Add a retention policy with tests for thousands of completed ephemeral agents, named wake/resume preservation, overlay refresh after start/complete, and no UI updates after shutdown.","notes":"Structural scan classified this as a cross-cutting lifecycle issue rather than a safe local patch."},"analysis":null,"path":null,"phase_id":null,"tags":["teammate","lifecycle","memory","TUI"],"affected_components":["packages/pi-maestro-teammate/src/extension/index.ts","packages/pi-maestro-teammate/src/tui/model-mapping-overlay.ts"],"feedback":[],"issue_history":[{"timestamp":"2026-07-16T17:34:55.6248679+08:00","from_status":null,"to_status":"open","actor":"agent","note":"Issue created from Odyssey structural discovery"}],"created_at":"2026-07-16T17:34:55.6248679+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-16T17:34:55.6248679+08:00","resolved_at":null,"resolution":null}
{"id":"ISS-20260716-004","title":"Goal projection publishes live state before durable persistence","status":"open","priority":2,"severity":"high","source":"discovery","milestone_ref":null,"phase_ref":"20260716-001-odyssey-review","gap_ref":null,"description":"Several Goal reconciliation and lifecycle paths assign the global activeGoal before appendEntry persistence and UI status updates finish. If persistence or a status setter throws, memory, durable history, and UI can diverge, unlike Todo's detached candidate and persist-first publish transaction.","fix_direction":"Introduce a detached Goal candidate transaction that validates and persists the next goal and status before publishing activeGoal, with rollback-safe lifecycle fencing and deterministic injected-failure tests.","context":{"location":"packages/pi-maestro-flow/src/tools/goal.ts:264","suggested_fix":"Centralize Goal mutation in collect-next -> persist entry/status -> publish global state, then migrate create/reconcile/pause/complete paths incrementally.","notes":"Routed as an issue because a local assignment reorder would not safely cover verifier timers, loop ownership, recovery, and statusline side effects."},"analysis":null,"path":null,"phase_id":null,"tags":["Goal","事务","持久化","状态一致性"],"affected_components":["packages/pi-maestro-flow/src/tools/goal.ts","packages/pi-maestro-flow/test/goal.test.ts"],"feedback":[],"issue_history":[{"timestamp":"2026-07-16T17:34:55.6248679+08:00","from_status":null,"to_status":"open","actor":"agent","note":"Issue created from Odyssey structural discovery"}],"created_at":"2026-07-16T17:34:55.6248679+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-16T17:34:55.6248679+08:00","resolved_at":null,"resolution":null}
{"id":"ISS-20260716-005","title":"Config stores lack cross-process OCC and workspace containment","status":"open","priority":2,"severity":"high","source":"discovery","milestone_ref":null,"phase_ref":"20260716-001-odyssey-review","gap_ref":null,"description":"Permission settings, Hook trust, Smart Search config, and teammate model routing use independent read-modify-write stores without a shared revision or cross-process lock. Concurrent processes can lose unrelated updates. Permission local settings also derive .pi paths without proving the target remains inside the workspace when .pi is a directory symlink.","fix_direction":"Adopt a shared revisioned JSON store protocol with unique private temp files, optimistic compare-and-swap or per-file lock, realpath containment for workspace-owned stores, crash recovery, and unknown-field preservation.","context":{"location":"packages/pi-maestro-flow/src/permissions/settings.ts:53","suggested_fix":"Build one reusable JSON mutation primitive, then migrate permission settings, Hook trust, Smart Search config, and teammate model routing with multi-process interleaving and symlink-boundary tests.","notes":"The current DISCOVER fix only addresses same-process serialization and temp-file collisions for permission/trust writes; cross-process OCC and containment remain intentionally routed here."},"analysis":null,"path":null,"phase_id":null,"tags":["配置","OCC","symlink","并发写"],"affected_components":["packages/pi-maestro-flow/src/permissions/settings.ts","packages/pi-maestro-flow/src/hooks/trust.ts","packages/pi-maestro-flow/src/tools/smart-search-config.ts","packages/pi-maestro-teammate/src/models/model-routing.ts"],"feedback":[],"issue_history":[{"timestamp":"2026-07-16T17:34:55.6248679+08:00","from_status":null,"to_status":"open","actor":"agent","note":"Issue created from Odyssey cross-store discovery"}],"created_at":"2026-07-16T17:34:55.6248679+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-16T17:34:55.6248679+08:00","resolved_at":null,"resolution":null}
{"id":"ISS-20260716-006","title":"Subprocess runners lack one cross-platform termination contract","status":"open","priority":2,"severity":"high","source":"discovery","milestone_ref":null,"phase_ref":"20260716-001-odyssey-review","gap_ref":null,"description":"Hook, LSP, Smart Search POSIX, and other CLI runners use different timeout, output-bound, AbortSignal, and process-tree termination behaviors. Some paths kill only the direct child, allowing shell or language-server descendants to survive cancellation, timeout, shutdown, or output overflow.","fix_direction":"Extract a shared subprocess controller with once-only settlement, byte-bounded collectors, AbortSignal, timeout, Windows taskkill tree handling, POSIX process groups, escalation, and listener/timer cleanup.","context":{"location":"packages/pi-maestro-flow/src/hooks/runner.ts:65","suggested_fix":"Migrate Hook runner, LSP shutdown, Smart Search, and Workflow CLI adapter to the same tested controller; cover descendant survival, ignored SIGTERM, overflow, abort, and double-settle races on Windows and POSIX.","notes":"Hook runner is also represented by ISS-20260715-001; this issue captures the broader cross-runner architectural gap discovered by structural and historical scans."},"analysis":null,"path":null,"phase_id":null,"tags":["子进程","进程树","timeout","AbortSignal"],"affected_components":["packages/pi-maestro-flow/src/hooks/runner.ts","packages/pi-maestro-flow/src/tools/lsp/client.ts","packages/pi-maestro-flow/src/tools/smart-search.ts","packages/pi-maestro-flow/src/session/cli-adapter.ts"],"feedback":[],"issue_history":[{"timestamp":"2026-07-16T17:34:55.6248679+08:00","from_status":null,"to_status":"open","actor":"agent","note":"Issue created from Odyssey process-runner discovery"}],"created_at":"2026-07-16T17:34:55.6248679+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-16T17:34:55.6248679+08:00","resolved_at":null,"resolution":null}
{"id":"ISS-20260716-007","title":"Flow 0.4.10 release depends on unpublished teammate 0.4.5","status":"open","priority":2,"severity":"high","source":"verification","milestone_ref":null,"phase_ref":"20260716-001-odyssey-review","gap_ref":null,"description":"pi-maestro-flow 0.4.10 correctly pins pi-maestro-teammate 0.4.5, but the registry does not yet contain teammate 0.4.5. Local dual-tarball verification proves the code contract but not independent registry resolution; publishing Flow first would produce an uninstallable release.","fix_direction":"Publish and verify pi-maestro-teammate 0.4.5 first, then publish pi-maestro-flow 0.4.10 and run a fresh registry-only consumer smoke without local tarballs or symlinks.","context":{"location":"packages/pi-maestro-flow/package.json:66","suggested_fix":"Release order: teammate 0.4.5 -> npm view/install/export smoke -> Flow 0.4.10 -> registry-only packed consumer Session/Run smoke.","notes":"This is a release sequencing gate, not a reason to weaken the exact dependency or reuse already-published 0.4.4."},"analysis":null,"path":null,"phase_id":null,"tags":["release","registry","packaging","依赖顺序"],"affected_components":["packages/pi-maestro-teammate/package.json","packages/pi-maestro-flow/package.json","packages/pi-maestro-flow/test/packed-consumer-e2e.test.mjs"],"feedback":[],"issue_history":[{"timestamp":"2026-07-16T17:34:55.6248679+08:00","from_status":null,"to_status":"open","actor":"agent","note":"Issue created from Odyssey registry verification"}],"created_at":"2026-07-16T17:34:55.6248679+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-16T17:34:55.6248679+08:00","resolved_at":null,"resolution":null}
{"id":"ISS-20260726-001","title":"根 package.json 的 pi-maestro-flow/pi-maestro-teammate 锁在 ^0.4.1，实际为 0.5.0","status":"open","priority":2,"severity":"medium","source":"improve-odyssey","description":"package.json:98-99 声明 \"pi-maestro-flow\": \"^0.4.1\" 与 \"pi-maestro-teammate\": \"^0.4.1\"，而两个 workspace 包实际都是 0.5.0（^0.4.1 = >=0.4.1 <0.5.0，不满足）。与本轮已修的 H7（flow 内部锁 0.4.7 vs workspace 0.5.0）是同一类漂移。\n\n实测复核（重要，未按发现者的严重度直接采信）：当前 node_modules/pi-maestro-flow 与 node_modules/pi-maestro-teammate 都是指向 workspace 的 SYMLINK、版本 0.5.0——也就是说 npm 的 workspace 链接优先于这个范围，'干净安装会拉 registry 0.4.x 副本' 这一预测症状在本机并未复现。未做 rm -rf node_modules 的真实干净安装验证（破坏性，且仓库有并发会话在工作）。\n\n因此按 medium 而非 high 记录，需要人判断的点在于：根 package.json 的 dependencies 有 124 项、按字母排的扁平化传递依赖清单（p-retry / pac-proxy-agent / parse5 / protobufjs …），而且根包自身就叫 pi-maestro-flow —— 它依赖了它自己。这强烈提示这份清单是机器生成/vendored 产物，那两条 workspace 条目很可能是副产品而非有意的锁。所以正确修法不一定是把范围改成 ^0.5.0，可能是把这两条移除；这需要先搞清楚这份扁平清单为什么存在。未擅自修改。","fix_direction":"","context":{"location":"","suggested_fix":"","notes":""},"tags":["packaging","workspace","version-pin"],"affected_components":[],"feedback":[],"issue_history":[{"timestamp":"2026-07-26T07:47:30.682Z","from_status":null,"to_status":"open","actor":"maestro-cli","note":"Issue created"}],"created_at":"2026-07-26T07:47:30.682Z","updated_at":"2026-07-26T07:47:30.682Z","resolved_at":null,"resolution":null}
{"id":"ISS-20260726-002","title":"flow 硬锁 @earendil-works/pi-tui@0.74.0，与 cockpit 的 peer >=0.80 冲突","status":"open","priority":3,"severity":"medium","source":"improve-odyssey","description":"packages/pi-maestro-flow/package.json:81 把 @earendil-works/pi-tui 硬锁为精确版本 0.74.0（runtime dep），flow 的 devDeps 里 pi-agent-core/pi-ai/pi-coding-agent 也都是 0.74.0。而 packages/pi-cockpit/package.json:31 声明 peer \"@earendil-works/pi-tui\": \">=0.80\"，packages/pi-maestro-teammate 的 devDeps 是 0.80.3。\n\n实测复核：根 node_modules/@earendil-works/pi-tui 实际安装版本为 0.74.0，即 flow 的精确锁在 hoist 后胜出，cockpit 的 >=0.80 peer 当前处于被违反状态。同时 flow 通过 pi-maestro-teammate/v1/* 消费 teammate 的公开 API，而后者是按 0.80.3 做的类型检查——跨包类型/类型剥离偏斜的风险与 H7 同源。\n\n未修：这是'本仓库到底对齐哪个 pi 版本'的依赖策略决策，把 flow 抬到 0.80.x 可能撞上 TUI API 变更，超出本轮 src/compaction/ 的范围，需要人决定目标版本后统一对齐。\n\n附：包边界本身是干净的——flow 只通过 pi-maestro-teammate/v1/* 公开子路径引用 teammate，无 /src/ 或 /dist/ 深导入（已复核 extension/index.ts:153-154, tools/delegate.ts:11, tools/direct-teammate.ts:1-3, tools/explore.ts:11, tools/goal.ts:4,41）。","fix_direction":"","context":{"location":"","suggested_fix":"","notes":""},"tags":["packaging","peer-deps","pi-tui"],"affected_components":[],"feedback":[],"issue_history":[{"timestamp":"2026-07-26T07:47:31.883Z","from_status":null,"to_status":"open","actor":"maestro-cli","note":"Issue created"}],"created_at":"2026-07-26T07:47:31.883Z","updated_at":"2026-07-26T07:47:31.883Z","resolved_at":null,"resolution":null}
{"id":"ISS-20260726-003","title":"ActiveAgent 的 status/sleptAt/sleepMs 是散字段，睡眠时长累加只存在于唯一的 wake helper","status":"open","priority":3,"severity":"medium","source":"improve-odyssey","description":"packages/pi-maestro-teammate/src/shared/types.ts:172-178 —— ActiveAgent 的 status、sleptAt、sleepMs、retry、resultReadyAt 必须同步变更，但是五个互不关联的散字段。与本轮已修的 compaction 熔断器（两个散字段导致冷却自动复位时不清 breakerNotified、第二次及以后跳闸永不告警）是同一形状。\n\n不变式只活在两个 helper 里：入睡（extension/index.ts:3494-3499 置 status=sleeping + sleptAt）与唤醒（index.ts:2078-2081 置 status=running + sleepMs += now-sleptAt + 清 sleptAt）。但另有约 4 处直接把 status 置回 running 的位置（index.ts:814, 1541-1543, 4534-4536）只重置了 retry/resultReadyAt 的子集，既不累加 sleepMs 也不清 sleptAt。\n\n可能的漂移：任何一次对'已入睡 agent'的 status→running 若未复制 sleepMs 累加逻辑，就会把 sleptAt 悬在那里，随后 agentActiveMs()（index.ts:3775-3776）与 attach-overlay.ts:89-90 的 total - sleepMs - (now - sleptAt) 会对一个 RUNNING 的 agent 持续减去一段幻影睡眠区间——显示的活跃/已用时长每 tick 缩水，并可能变成负数。\n\n今天只是潜伏：那几处目前都发生在初次 spawn（此时 sleptAt 尚未设置）。发现者为 gen-structural agent，我未独立复核行号与调用点。建议修法是把这几个字段收拢成值对象（与本轮 CompactionBreakerState 同样的做法）。","fix_direction":"","context":{"location":"","suggested_fix":"","notes":""},"tags":["teammate","state-drift","value-object"],"affected_components":[],"feedback":[],"issue_history":[{"timestamp":"2026-07-26T07:47:33.866Z","from_status":null,"to_status":"open","actor":"maestro-cli","note":"Issue created"}],"created_at":"2026-07-26T07:47:33.866Z","updated_at":"2026-07-26T07:47:33.866Z","resolved_at":null,"resolution":null}
{"id":"ISS-20260726-004","title":"agent 选择树的环检测由单行 visited 守卫独撑，无测试围栏","status":"open","priority":4,"severity":"low","source":"improve-odyssey","description":"packages/pi-maestro-teammate/src/extension/index.ts:439 的 'if (visited.has(agent.correlationId)) return;'（配合 :440 的 .add）单行维系着'每个 agent 只渲染一次、且沿 spawnedBy 成环时能终止'这一属性。删掉它，成环会导致无限递归（栈溢出）或重复行。\n\n围栏缺口：现有树测试（packages/pi-maestro-teammate/test/graph-status-and-structured-output.test.ts:892-894）只构造无环树并断言前缀，删掉守卫后全部照样绿。\n\n与本轮 compaction 的同类问题一致——那边'缓存前缀稳定性'全靠 recordPrune 的一行 has() 早退兜着、同样零测试；本轮已为其补了专门的围栏测试（recorded prunes are never re-recorded with a fresh replacement）。此处建议同样补一个成环用例。\n\n严重度 low：成环在正常情况下不应出现，属休眠风险。发现者为 gen-structural agent，我未独立复核行号。","fix_direction":"","context":{"location":"","suggested_fix":"","notes":""},"tags":["teammate","test-fence","invariant"],"affected_components":[],"feedback":[],"issue_history":[{"timestamp":"2026-07-26T07:47:48.467Z","from_status":null,"to_status":"open","actor":"maestro-cli","note":"Issue created"}],"created_at":"2026-07-26T07:47:48.467Z","updated_at":"2026-07-26T07:47:48.467Z","resolved_at":null,"resolution":null}
{"id":"ISS-20260726-005","title":"mcp-auth-flow 的 clearPendingAuth 在 setTimeout 中 fire-and-forget，存储操作无 catch","status":"open","priority":5,"severity":"low","source":"improve-odyssey","description":"packages/pi-maestro-flow/src/mcp/mcp-auth-flow.ts:244 在 setTimeout 里 'void clearPendingAuth(...)'。其内部 try/catch 只覆盖 transport.close，getOAuthState/clearOAuthState（:266-268）可能 reject 且无 handler。\n\n不是本轮审计到的那个缺陷形态（失败会以 unhandledRejection 浮现，而非被静默吞掉），且仓库其余 fire-and-forget 站点要么有 .catch、要么调用的是自捕获函数（gen-syntax 全仓扫描确认：extension/index.ts:4017/:4683 有 .catch，session/cli-adapter.ts:232 双参 then，gui/gui-server.ts:239 的 removeDiscovery 自捕获，compaction 的 cleanupSpillDir 自捕获）。\n\n纯卫生问题，加一行 .catch 即可。超出本轮 src/compaction/ 范围，未修。","fix_direction":"","context":{"location":"","suggested_fix":"","notes":""},"tags":["mcp","error-handling","hygiene"],"affected_components":[],"feedback":[],"issue_history":[{"timestamp":"2026-07-26T07:47:57.453Z","from_status":null,"to_status":"open","actor":"maestro-cli","note":"Issue created"}],"created_at":"2026-07-26T07:47:57.453Z","updated_at":"2026-07-26T07:47:57.453Z","resolved_at":null,"resolution":null}
{"id":"ISS-20260726-006","title":"cockpit: todo 与 agents 面板的默认展开状态不对称","status":"open","priority":4,"severity":"low","source":"ui-odyssey","description":"todo 面板默认折叠（只显示汇总行），agents 面板默认展开成完整树。两者信息密度接近、位置也对称（aboveEditor / belowEditor），默认行为却相反，用户需要分别记忆。\n\n来源：20260726-001-odyssey-ui 审计 visual-7，判定为 deferred 而非 defect——哪个默认更好取决于实际使用数据，这是一个决策而不是修复。\n\n候选方向：(a) 两者都默认折叠，展开由用户显式触发；(b) 两者都跟随'有活跃项就展开'的规则；(c) 保持现状并在文档里说明理由。","fix_direction":"","context":{"location":"","suggested_fix":"","notes":""},"tags":["cockpit","ui","defaults"],"affected_components":[],"feedback":[],"issue_history":[{"timestamp":"2026-07-26T07:54:43.370Z","from_status":null,"to_status":"open","actor":"maestro-cli","note":"Issue created"}],"created_at":"2026-07-26T07:54:43.370Z","updated_at":"2026-07-26T07:54:43.370Z","resolved_at":null,"resolution":null}
{"id":"ISS-20260726-007","title":"cockpit: /cockpit 设置面板缺少取消/回滚路径","status":"open","priority":3,"severity":"medium","source":"ui-odyssey","description":"设置面板每次改动立即保存，Esc 只是关闭，没有'放弃本次修改'的路径。误按一个字母加速键就会改掉配置并落盘。\n\n缓解现状：改动带可见保存状态（✓ saved / · saving… / ✗ save failed），不会静默丢失，因此判定为缺功能而非缺陷。\n\n来源：20260726-001-odyssey-ui 审计 interaction-5。\n\n候选方向：进入面板时快照 config，Esc 走'关闭并保留'，另给一个显式 revert 键回到快照；或改为'Enter 提交、Esc 放弃'的两段式，但那会牺牲当前即时反馈的手感。","fix_direction":"","context":{"location":"","suggested_fix":"","notes":""},"tags":["cockpit","ui","interaction"],"affected_components":[],"feedback":[],"issue_history":[{"timestamp":"2026-07-26T07:54:45.341Z","from_status":null,"to_status":"open","actor":"maestro-cli","note":"Issue created"}],"created_at":"2026-07-26T07:54:45.341Z","updated_at":"2026-07-26T07:54:45.341Z","resolved_at":null,"resolution":null}
{"id":"ISS-20260726-009","title":"flow/teammate: 六个 overlay 与两个 widget 完全不感知终端高度","status":"open","priority":3,"severity":"medium","source":"ui-odyssey","description":"跨包扫描确认：tui.terminal.rows 在 packages/pi-cockpit 之外**整个仓库无一处使用**。\n\n【overlay 方向：按百分比申请高度，却画固定行数】\n所有 overlay 经 ctx.ui.custom(..., { overlayOptions: { maxHeight: '90%'|'92%' } }) 挂载，\n而 Component.render(width) 拿不到高度，于是全部硬编码行数：\n\n- tui/todo-overlay.ts:103-104,120-123  固定 8（挂载点 extension/index.ts:1067, 90%）\n- tui/goal-overlay.ts:115-116,131-132  固定 8 + detailLines 5/12（挂载点 :1094, 90%）\n- tui/session-overlay.ts:114           固定 7（挂载点 :1049, 90%）\n- skills/skill-manager-tui.ts:47       MAX_VISIBLE = 12（挂载点 skill-manager.ts:228, 92%）\n- mcp/mcp-panel.ts:174                 MAX_VISIBLE = 12（挂载点 mcp-manager-flow.ts:136, 92%）\n- tui/smart-search-config.ts:42        MAX_VISIBLE_ITEMS = 10（挂载点 :328, 90%）\n\n【widget 方向：可能占掉过多行】\n- flow extension/index.ts:1712  ordered.slice(0, 8)，aboveEditor todo 面板；\n  叠加汇总行 + runs 计数 + widgetRunsFocusLines(:1789 slice(0,3)) + 'N more'，最坏约 13-14 行\n- teammate extension/index.ts:716  maxVisible 由**宽度**推导（<20→3, <40→4, else 6），从不看高度\n\n违反 spec「终端 chrome 的垂直行预算」(ui-conventions)。\n参考实现：packages/pi-cockpit/src/viewport.ts（panelRows / fitRows / overlayListRows），\n以及 teammate/src/tui/attach-overlay.ts:426-434（仓库内已有的正确做法，走 render(width, height)）。\n\npi-cockpit 实测：24 行终端上仅做宽度降级时 chrome 占 20/24（83%），加上高度预算后降到 8/24（33%）。\n\n来源：20260726-001-odyssey-ui GENERALIZE 阶段跨包扫描，两轮独立复核一致，关键点已人工验证。","fix_direction":"","context":{"location":"","suggested_fix":"","notes":""},"tags":["flow","teammate","ui","responsive"],"affected_components":[],"feedback":[],"issue_history":[{"timestamp":"2026-07-26T07:57:43.419Z","from_status":null,"to_status":"open","actor":"maestro-cli","note":"Issue created"}],"created_at":"2026-07-26T07:57:43.419Z","updated_at":"2026-07-26T07:57:43.419Z","resolved_at":null,"resolution":null}
{"id":"ISS-20260726-010","title":"flow/teammate: agent/子进程文本入库未剥离控制字符","status":"open","priority":2,"severity":"high","source":"ui-odyssey","description":"两个包都没有 sanitizeExtensionStatusText 等价物。已有两个局部 helper 证明作者知道这个问题但未统一应用：\nmcp/mcp-panel.ts:77-84 sanitizeDisplayText（strip [\\u0000-\\u001f\\u007f-\\u009f]）、tui/input-text.ts sanitizeSingleLineInput（仅输入侧）。\n\n未净化的入库边界：\n- flow tools/todo.ts:510,631        subject 为模型撰写的 tool arg，直接入 state（批量路径 :573 只 trim）\n                                    渲染点 extension/index.ts:1820-1823、todo-overlay.ts:152,209-210\n- flow tools/goal.ts:1267           objective 仅 trim；渲染点 goal-widget.ts:61、goal-overlay.ts:162\n                                    （同文件 :1093-1118 的 boundedSecretText 净化很严，唯独漏了 objective）\n- flow swarm/projection.ts:202      stringValue 只 trim，数据来自外部 worker 写的 JSON；\n                                    渲染点 swarm-overlay.ts:55,97,137-141 在 box 框内，换行直接撑破框\n- flow tools/bash-bg.ts:216-217,115 job.tail += d.toString('utf8') 原始子进程字节，\n                                    再作为 outputTail 发布进权威快照 —— 置信度最高的一处\n- teammate extension/index.ts:1630-1631（及 :4527 镜像）  lastMessage 仅按字节截断\n                                    （同文件 :566 对同一字段调了 sanitizeSingleLineInput，边界不一致已被证实）\n- teammate extension/index.ts:2043,2104,2343,4885  message.slice(0,100) 按字符切后入 outputLog\n\n关键机理（pi-cockpit 已踩过）：truncateToWidth 量的是**可见宽度**，\\n 与 ESC 均为 0 列，\n因此宽度断言对这类注入完全免疫 —— cockpit 当时 82 个测试全绿，而 widget 行里含真实的 \\x1b[2J。\n修复必须在入库边界做单一收口，而不是在每个渲染点补。\n\n参考实现：packages/pi-cockpit/src/extension-status.ts sanitizeExtensionStatusText，\n以及 agents-store.ts / todo-store.ts 的 clean() 收口方式。\n\n来源：20260726-001-odyssey-ui GENERALIZE 阶段跨包扫描，两轮独立复核一致。\n已排除的误报：statusline.ts:480-492（读取的 key 全为 Flow 自撰且经枚举/正则约束，无注入路径）。","fix_direction":"","context":{"location":"","suggested_fix":"","notes":""},"tags":["flow","teammate","security","ui"],"affected_components":[],"feedback":[],"issue_history":[{"timestamp":"2026-07-26T07:57:47.562Z","from_status":null,"to_status":"open","actor":"maestro-cli","note":"Issue created"}],"created_at":"2026-07-26T07:57:47.562Z","updated_at":"2026-07-26T07:57:47.562Z","resolved_at":null,"resolution":null}
{"id":"ISS-20260726-011","title":"flow: statusline 与 runs 计数行整行盲截断，failed 段位优先级倒置","status":"open","priority":3,"severity":"medium","source":"ui-odyssey","description":"- statusline/statusline.ts:348  renderWorkflowStatusline 把 [session, recovery, status, runText, chain, gates, budget]\n  join 后整行 truncateToWidth。只有一个粗粒度 <80 分档丢掉 gates/budget，档内 chain/runText 无声消失。\n  同文件 :296-317 的 renderLine1 已经用了正确的 6 级 candidate ladder —— 修复样板就在上面两个函数。\n\n- extension/index.ts:1701 + :1782  widgetRunsCountLine 生成 'Runs N · N done · N running · N failed'，\n  **failed 拼在最后**，于是窄终端上最先被砍的正是最该保留的段位。这是优先级倒置，不只是盲截断。\n\n- tui/goal-widget.ts:101  chips.join(' · ') 后整行截断，没有 '+N more'，goal 无痕消失（低危）。\n- tui/todo-overlay.ts:169 header 把计数与 scope 选择器 join 后 fitLine；被截掉的恰是用户正在用 ←/→ 操作的控件。\n\n违反 spec「终端状态与 Footer 非颜色可达规则」中 'Footer MUST 按优先级折叠，禁止整行盲截断'。\n仓库内已有的正确实现：todo-overlay.ts:310-318 fitSegments、statusline.ts:197-203 renderFirstFittingLine、\nextension/index.ts:1755-1765 renderTodoSummary。pi-cockpit 侧为 src/layout.ts fitSegmentsByPriority\n（带 clippable / minWidth）。\n\n来源：20260726-001-odyssey-ui GENERALIZE 阶段跨包扫描。\nteammate 包无此模式命中（逐个读过 renderProgress/renderSingleResult/renderMultiResult）。","fix_direction":"","context":{"location":"","suggested_fix":"","notes":""},"tags":["flow","ui","truncation"],"affected_components":[],"feedback":[],"issue_history":[{"timestamp":"2026-07-26T07:58:12.153Z","from_status":null,"to_status":"open","actor":"maestro-cli","note":"Issue created"}],"created_at":"2026-07-26T07:58:12.153Z","updated_at":"2026-07-26T07:58:12.153Z","resolved_at":null,"resolution":null}
{"id":"ISS-20260726-012","title":"teammate: 根 execute 与 handleProxyRequest 是两份独立的调度实现，已产生实际漂移","status":"open","priority":1,"severity":"critical","source":"improve-odyssey","description":"packages/pi-maestro-teammate/src/extension/index.ts\n\n同一套嵌套派发编排在 tool.execute（根路径）与 handleProxyRequest（代理路径）中各写了一份，约 200-300 行。本轮修复反复撞到这个成本：几乎每一条 finding 都要在两处各改一次，且已发现两处漂移是只改了一边造成的。\n\n本轮亲历的证据（每条都需要双改）：\n- ARCH-3：TEAMMATE_COMPLETE_EVENT 根路径前台发、后台不发；代理路径两条都不发\n- SEC-2 expectsStructuredOutput：4 个 agent 构造点，两份实现各 2 个\n- REL-7 bindAgentName：4 处 namedAgents.set，两份实现各 2 处\n- PERF-3/OBS-11 的日志游标逻辑只存在于根路径；代理路径另有一套 aggregateTaskProgress\n\n修复方向：把 makeOptions/progressState/logState/settle 收敛为一个以\n(state, params, correlationId, depth, reply-or-return) 为入参的编排函数，\n两条路径只在结果如何回传上分叉。\n\n风险：这是本包最核心的执行路径，且刚经历一轮密集行为修改（本 session 十余次提交）。\n应作为独立 run 进行，先补齐 handleProxyRequest 的行为测试（见 MNT-7），\n以等价性为唯一验收标准。\n\n来源：20260726-odyssey-improve-teammate-state 六维审计 ARCH-1 / MNT-2（critical）","fix_direction":"","context":{"location":"","suggested_fix":"","notes":""},"tags":["teammate","architecture","duplication"],"affected_components":[],"feedback":[],"issue_history":[{"timestamp":"2026-07-26T11:27:49.458Z","from_status":null,"to_status":"open","actor":"maestro-cli","note":"Issue created"}],"created_at":"2026-07-26T11:27:49.458Z","updated_at":"2026-07-26T11:27:49.458Z","resolved_at":null,"resolution":null}
{"id":"ISS-20260726-013","title":"teammate: 抽出 child-request 簇为叶子模块，解开 public/v1 的 55 倍依赖代价","status":"open","priority":2,"severity":"high","source":"improve-odyssey","description":"packages/pi-maestro-teammate/src/extension/index.ts\n\n实测（静态运行时依赖图遍历，import type 已排除）：\n  v1/index.ts（= 包根 \".\"）  33 模块 / 13340 行\n  v1/extension.ts             23 模块 / 13116 行\n  v1/types.ts                  2 模块 /   240 行\nextension.ts 贡献了 barrel 约 98% 的重量；只想取一个类型常量的消费者付 55 倍代价。\n\n已确认无法靠 export type 解决：v1/extension.ts 导出的\ncreateTeammateDirectChildRequestHandler / handleChildInteractionRequest /\nhandleChildRpcUiRequest 确实是运行时函数（宿主自行驱动 runTeammate 时\n必须中继子进程的权限与提问），且唯一的类型已经是 export type。\n\n正确修法是把 child-request 簇抽成 src/extension/child-requests.ts（叶子），\nindex.ts 再导出保持兼容。需迁移的符号（行号会漂移，按名字找）：\n  RelayedQuestionOption / RelayedQuestion\n  handleChildInteractionRequest / handleChildRpcUiRequest\n  TeammateDirectChildRequestHandlerOptions / createTeammateDirectChildRequestHandler\n  replyUnavailableDirectProxy / replyProxyFailure\n  TeammateInteractionQueue / createTeammateInteractionQueue\n  replyChildRequestFailure / showRelayedPermission / showRelayedQuestions\n  normalizeRelayedQuestion / replyInteraction / interactionDetail / questionSummary / isRecord\n簇内还需要：AGENT_BUFFER_LIMITS、TEAMMATE_INTERACTION_TIMEOUT_MS、\nTEAMMATE_INTERACTION_QUEUE_LIMIT、trimAgentBuffers、logNeedsNoTrim\n\n关键决策点：trimAgentBuffers 依赖 truncateUtf8Tail（在 runs/execution.ts）。\n  留在原处 → 新叶子仍拖进 execution.ts：约 11 模块 / 4800 行（省 63%，\n            但已能甩掉 @earendil-works/pi-tui 与全部 4 个 TUI 模块）\n  一并下沉到 shared/ → 约 5 模块 / 1100 行（省 92%，连 cross-spawn 也不再拖）\n建议走第二条，并在 test/public-api-surface.test.ts 的 LEAF_SUBPATHS 里加上 extension.ts。\n\n护栏已就位：test/public-api-surface.test.ts 静态遍历运行时图，任一窄入口\n触达 src/extension/index.ts 即失败，并带正向对照防止遍历器空转。\n\n来源：20260726-odyssey-improve-teammate-state ARCH-6（high）；\n同时是 MNT-1/ARCH-11（index.ts 单文件 12 类职责）的第一刀。","fix_direction":"","context":{"location":"","suggested_fix":"","notes":""},"tags":["teammate","architecture","layering"],"affected_components":[],"feedback":[],"issue_history":[{"timestamp":"2026-07-26T11:28:32.685Z","from_status":null,"to_status":"open","actor":"maestro-cli","note":"Issue created"}],"created_at":"2026-07-26T11:28:32.685Z","updated_at":"2026-07-26T11:28:32.685Z","resolved_at":null,"resolution":null}
{"id":"ISS-20260726-014","title":"teammate: 四套状态类型并存，无单一真相源","status":"open","priority":2,"severity":"high","source":"improve-odyssey","description":"packages/pi-maestro-teammate/src/shared/types.ts\n\n并存的四套：\n  AgentStatus                     6 态（含 sleeping）\n  AgentProgressStatus             5 态\n  ChildAgentCallSnapshot.status   4 态，内联字面量\n  TeammateWaitStatus              9 态\n外加正交标志 resultReadyAt / lifecyclePending / failedAt。\n\n本轮已完成的部分：\n- 展示侧已收敛到 src/shared/agent-status.ts（STATUS_PRESENTATION +\n  effectiveDisplayStatus），TUI 四处渲染点全部改为查表（提交 f800d87c）\n- ListedAgentStatus 仍是 ActiveAgent[\"status\"] | AgentProgressSnapshot[\"status\"] 的联合\n\n仍未收敛：\n- ChildAgentCallSnapshot.status 的 4 态内联字面量未纳入\n- MNT-5：completed 同名不同义 —— ActiveAgent 的 completed 是即将被移除的\n  瞬时墓碑标记（killAgent 里设置后立刻 delete），而 AgentProgressStatus 的\n  completed 是成功结束。本轮的失败墓碑改造（ae377f8d）让这个歧义更刺眼：\n  失败现在是 failed，成功是 sleeping，completed 只剩下正在被删除这一个含义。\n  建议改名为 terminated。\n- statusForWatchTarget / buildAgentList / agentWidgetRows 仍各自派生\n\n改名 completed→terminated 会触及 widget 过滤器、buildAgentSelectorRows、\nphysicalVisible 等多处判定，需要一次性完成并逐处核对，不宜与行为修复混在同一轮。\n\n来源：20260726-odyssey-improve-teammate-state ARCH-5 / MNT-5（high）","fix_direction":"","context":{"location":"","suggested_fix":"","notes":""},"tags":["teammate","types","state-model"],"affected_components":[],"feedback":[],"issue_history":[{"timestamp":"2026-07-26T11:28:33.327Z","from_status":null,"to_status":"open","actor":"maestro-cli","note":"Issue created"}],"created_at":"2026-07-26T11:28:33.327Z","updated_at":"2026-07-26T11:28:33.327Z","resolved_at":null,"resolution":null}
{"id":"ISS-20260726-015","title":"teammate: 包无类型检查关卡，tsc 下有 50 个真实 strict 错误","status":"open","priority":2,"severity":"high","source":"improve-odyssey","description":"packages/pi-maestro-teammate\n\n本轮已修：tsconfig.build.json 此前完全失效（tsc 直接报 53 个 TS5097），已重写；\npackage.json 新增 `npm run typecheck` 脚本。测试用的是 node\n--experimental-transform-types，只做类型擦除、不做类型检查，所以这些错误\n在 npm test 全绿的情况下一直不可见。\n\n当前 `npm run typecheck` 输出 50 个错误，分布：\n  src/extension/index.ts                     34\n  test/performance-buffers-and-spawn.test.ts 13\n  其余 3 个文件                                3\n\n主要类别（按出现次数）：\n1. isError does not exist in type AgentToolResult<T> —— 数量最多。\n   isError 是整个代码库都在设置、测试也在断言的运行时契约，\n   说明是上游 @earendil-works/pi-coding-agent 的 AgentToolResult 类型不完整，\n   不是本包的错误用法。需要先确认上游类型，不能靠 as 掩盖。\n2. agent.lease possibly undefined —— 真实的可空性缺口，应补判定而非断言。\n3. string | null 不可赋给 string（sessionFile 相关）\n4. Record<string, unknown> → RunTeammateParams 的不安全 cast\n\n因为第 1 类占多数且根因在上游类型，现在把 typecheck 接进 npm test 会直接红。\n故本轮只交付可运行的关卡，不设为强制。下一步：先判定 AgentToolResult\n是否应由上游修正，再决定本包是补声明合并还是等上游。\n\n来源：20260726-odyssey-improve-teammate-state MNT-4（high）","fix_direction":"","context":{"location":"","suggested_fix":"","notes":""},"tags":["teammate","types","ci"],"affected_components":[],"feedback":[],"issue_history":[{"timestamp":"2026-07-26T11:29:10.947Z","from_status":null,"to_status":"open","actor":"maestro-cli","note":"Issue created"}],"created_at":"2026-07-26T11:29:10.947Z","updated_at":"2026-07-26T11:29:10.947Z","resolved_at":null,"resolution":null}
{"id":"ISS-20260726-016","title":"teammate: handleProxyRequest 与 waitForTeammate 的行为测试覆盖不足","status":"open","priority":3,"severity":"medium","source":"improve-odyssey","description":"packages/pi-maestro-teammate\n\nMNT-7：handleProxyRequest（约 573 行）此前未导出，测试全靠 20 条源码正则断言。\n本轮已导出并新增行为测试（深度守卫 8 条、代理取消 6 条、发送授权 6 条），\n但覆盖的仍是入口判定，executeNested 的图/单任务分支尚无端到端行为测试。\n这是 ISS-20260726-012（两份调度实现合并）的前置条件 —— 没有等价性基线\n就不该动那次重构。\n\nMNT-10：waitForTeammate 有 9 种返回状态，本轮从 3 种提升到 7 种\n（completed/failed/result-ready/stalled/timeout/aborted/not-found 已覆盖）。\n仍缺：delayed（纯 waitMs 分支）、以及 aborted 在 waitMs 分支下的路径。\n\n来源：20260726-odyssey-improve-teammate-state MNT-7（high）/ MNT-10（medium）","fix_direction":"","context":{"location":"","suggested_fix":"","notes":""},"tags":["teammate","test-coverage"],"affected_components":[],"feedback":[],"issue_history":[{"timestamp":"2026-07-26T11:29:11.681Z","from_status":null,"to_status":"open","actor":"maestro-cli","note":"Issue created"}],"created_at":"2026-07-26T11:29:11.681Z","updated_at":"2026-07-26T11:29:11.681Z","resolved_at":null,"resolution":null}
{"id":"ISS-20260726-017","title":"teammate: /teammate-handoff-reload 绕过 lease 校验且目标路径未做包含性校验","status":"open","priority":3,"severity":"medium","source":"improve-odyssey","description":"packages/pi-maestro-teammate/src/extension/index.ts\n\n两处：\n1. pi.on(\"input\") 中，任何以 `/teammate-handoff-reload ` 开头的输入在\n   expectedLease.owner === \"none\" 时直接 return continue，完全跳过\n   unwrapLeasedMessage / sameLeaseToken 校验。跳过本身是有意的\n   （reload 在 parked 期间、所有权归还之前到达），但它把一个前缀字符串\n   变成了绕过租约的通道。\n2. registerCommand(\"teammate-handoff-reload\") 的 handler 直接\n   decodeURIComponent(args) 后 ctx.switchSession(sessionFile)，\n   对目标路径没有任何包含性校验。子进程内的提示注入若能让模型输出该前缀，\n   即可把会话切到任意路径。\n\n未在本轮修复的原因：正确的收窄需要确定合法会话根从哪里来 ——\n子进程环境里没有现成的 session root 变量，而我能想到的几种推导\n（当前 sessionFile 的祖先目录等）都无法在本轮充分验证。\n半吊子的包含性检查比一个记录清楚的 issue 更糟。\n\n修复方向：由根进程在 spawn 时下发允许的 session 根（新增 env 或握手字段），\n子进程据此对 resolve 后的路径做 path.relative 包含性判定，越界拒绝并记日志。\n\n来源：20260726-odyssey-improve-teammate-state SEC-7（low，但属信任边界，按 medium 处理）","fix_direction":"","context":{"location":"","suggested_fix":"","notes":""},"tags":["teammate","security"],"affected_components":[],"feedback":[],"issue_history":[{"timestamp":"2026-07-26T11:29:12.483Z","from_status":null,"to_status":"open","actor":"maestro-cli","note":"Issue created"}],"created_at":"2026-07-26T11:29:12.483Z","updated_at":"2026-07-26T11:29:12.483Z","resolved_at":null,"resolution":null}
{"id":"ISS-20260726-018","title":"teammate: 前台调用无实时进度投影，选择器每帧重建整棵树","status":"open","priority":3,"severity":"medium","source":"improve-odyssey","description":"packages/pi-maestro-teammate/src/extension/index.ts\n\nOBS-10（medium）：前台（background === false）teammate 调用完全没有实时进度投影。\nonUpdate 只在 params.background !== false 时调用，于是用户在最需要看到进展的\n阻塞等待场景下什么都看不到，直到结果一次性返回。\n\nPERF-10（low）：Alt+R agent 选择面板每帧重建整棵 agent 树，并按 1Hz 无条件重绘，\n与是否有变化无关。本轮 TUI 侧已引入 memo 与脏标记机制（提交 f800d87c 的\nPERF-4/5/8），此处可沿用同一模式。\n\nMNT-12（medium）：agentWidgetRows 的状态→展示文案是 8 层嵌套三元，\n另有 5 层嵌套三元计算时长。本轮已把 TUI 四处渲染点收敛到\nshared/agent-status.ts 的 STATUS_PRESENTATION，agentWidgetRows 尚未接入，\n接入即可消除这两处嵌套。\n\n来源：20260726-odyssey-improve-teammate-state OBS-10 / PERF-10 / MNT-12","fix_direction":"","context":{"location":"","suggested_fix":"","notes":""},"tags":["teammate","observability","performance"],"affected_components":[],"feedback":[],"issue_history":[{"timestamp":"2026-07-26T11:29:35.804Z","from_status":null,"to_status":"open","actor":"maestro-cli","note":"Issue created"}],"created_at":"2026-07-26T11:29:35.804Z","updated_at":"2026-07-26T11:29:35.804Z","resolved_at":null,"resolution":null}
